{"candidateAnswer":"Got involved with a religious community and got a faith symbol","evidence":"[D14:10 | 5:04 pm on 6 May, 2023] Maria: Just yesterday I joined a nearby church. I wanted to feel closer to a community and my faith. So far it's been really great!\n[D11:10 | 6:13 pm on 10 April, 2023] Maria: I recently gave a few talks at the homeless shelter I volunteer at. It was really fulfilling and I received lots of compliments from other volunteers. It was a great reminder about why connecting with and helping others is so important. And, I bought a cross necklace to feel closer to my faith- which has made me happy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:91c86f35-dae8-50d6-b15d-0c3dbee0a22e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1b4c121d1b9d93c8b6c5e1872446462650c27010d64c51544f320ec2dc6cb9bc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What has Maria done to feel closer to her faith?","referenceAnswer":"Join a local church, buy a cross necklace","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1b4c121d1b9d93c8b6c5e1872446462650c27010d64c51544f320ec2dc6cb9bc"}}]}